# serializer version: 1
# name: test_format_fix_findings_message_points_to_artifact_without_count_claim
  'Round 2 requirements review needs work. Findings artifact: `requirements-review-findings`. Target artifact: `requirements`. Required read: software-development/procedure/lifecycle/fix-review-findings. Address the findings and report FIX COMPLETE. Read findings via: telec todo artifacts read slug-a requirements-review-findings'
# ---
# name: test_format_review_ground_shift_script_sends_scoped_follow_up
  '''
  REVIEW GROUND SHIFTED: slug-a
  
  Execute in order:
  
  telec sessions send rev-1 "Ground shifted for slug-a: origin/main merge advanced the review target from head-old to head-new. Keep focus on this todo only. Re-check only the overlapping reviewed files (src/a.py, src/b.py) and continue the same review session. If the merged changes are irrelevant to your existing findings, keep your current scope and verdict logic unchanged."
  
  Cancel the old heartbeat timer via KillShell(shell_id=<task_id>).
  Start a new non-blocking heartbeat timer via Bash(command="sleep 300", run_in_background=true) and save the new task_id.
  Wait for reviewer session rev-1 to report idle.
  When the signal arrives, call telec todo work slug-a.
  '''
# ---
# name: test_format_review_in_progress_script_reuses_live_reviewer
  '''
  REVIEW IN PROGRESS: slug-a
  
  Execute in order:
  
  Do not dispatch a new reviewer. Reuse live reviewer session rev-1.
  Cancel the old heartbeat timer via KillShell(shell_id=<task_id>).
  Start a new non-blocking heartbeat timer via Bash(command="sleep 300", run_in_background=true) and save the new task_id.
  Wait for reviewer session rev-1 to report idle.
  When the signal arrives, call telec todo work slug-a.
  '''
# ---
# name: test_format_review_needs_work_script_hands_findings_off_without_direct_link
  '''
  REVIEW NEEDS WORK: slug-a
  
  Execute in order:
  
  Hand findings off to the reviewer:
  telec sessions send reviewer-1 "A fixer is active at worker-1. Write your findings to the findings artifact and idle when done. The fixer will read the artifact on its next state-machine advance. Fix the findings Persist the full review-findings artifact and set verdict by arithmetic (APPROVE only when unresolved Critical and Important counts both reach zero). Then idle. The fixer reads your findings on its next state-machine advance."
  
  Cancel the old heartbeat timer via KillShell(shell_id=<task_id>).
  Start a new non-blocking heartbeat timer via Bash(command="sleep 300", run_in_background=true) and save the new task_id.
  Wait for the fixer to address findings and advance the state machine; the state machine will re-dispatch the reviewer when the artifact is updated.
  Wait for reviewer session reviewer-1 to report idle.
  When the reviewer idles, call telec todo prepare slug-a.
  '''
# ---
